{"seq":4,"slug":"real-time-constraints","title":"实时约束与时序分析","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/embedded-systems-iot/rtos-and-scheduling/real-time-constraints","wordCount":859,"readingTime":4,"html":"<h1 id=\"实时约束与时序分析\">实时约束与时序分析</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>实时系统的正确性不仅取决于计算结果的逻辑正确性，还取决于结果产生的时间。硬实时系统（Hard Real-Time）要求所有任务必须在截止时间之前完成，违反即视为系统失败；软实时系统（Soft Real-Time）允许偶尔错过截止时间，但会导致服务质量下降。时序分析是验证系统能否满足所有实时约束的关键方法。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[实时约束分析] --&gt; B[WCET 分析]&#10;    A --&gt; C[响应时间分析]&#10;    A --&gt; D[端到端延迟分析]&#10;    B --&gt; E[静态分析]&#10;    B --&gt; F[测量法]&#10;    C --&gt; G[单任务响应时间]&#10;    C --&gt; H[抢占与阻塞开销]&#10;    D --&gt; I[传感器到执行器延迟]&#10;    D --&gt; J[多核通信延迟]\">graph TD\n    A[实时约束分析] --&gt; B[WCET 分析]\n    A --&gt; C[响应时间分析]\n    A --&gt; D[端到端延迟分析]\n    B --&gt; E[静态分析]\n    B --&gt; F[测量法]\n    C --&gt; G[单任务响应时间]\n    C --&gt; H[抢占与阻塞开销]\n    D --&gt; I[传感器到执行器延迟]\n    D --&gt; J[多核通信延迟]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>实时类型</th>\n<th>截止时间违反后果</th>\n<th>典型领域</th>\n<th>分析方法</th>\n<th>认证要求</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>硬实时</td>\n<td>灾难性后果</td>\n<td>航空电子、汽车 ABS</td>\n<td>WCET + 形式化验证</td>\n<td>DO-178C、ISO 26262</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>固实时</td>\n<td>结果无价值</td>\n<td>视频解码、金融交易</td>\n<td>统计分析 + 测试</td>\n<td>行业规范</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>软实时</td>\n<td>服务质量下降</td>\n<td>多媒体播放、Web 服务</td>\n<td>平均/百分位分析</td>\n<td>SLA 承诺</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"wcet-最坏执行时间分析\">WCET 最坏执行时间分析</h2><p>WCET（Worst-Case Execution Time）是实时系统时序分析的基石。所有调度理论都建立在已知每个任务 WCET 的前提上。WCET 分析分为静态分析和基于测量的两大方法。</p>\n<h3 id=\"静态分析方法\">静态分析方法</h3><p>静态 WCET 分析通过程序控制流分析和硬件时序模型，在不执行程序的情况下推导执行时间上界：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// 示例：分析此函数的 WCET&#10;void process_packet(uint8_t *buf, uint16_t len) {&#10;    uint16_t checksum = 0;&#10;    for (uint16_t i = 0; i &lt; len; i++) {      // 循环上界：len ≤ MAX_PACKET_SIZE&#10;        checksum += buf[i];&#10;        if (buf[i] == ESCAPE_CHAR) {           // 条件分支&#10;            checksum += buf[++i];              // 最坏路径&#10;        }&#10;    }&#10;    if (checksum != expected) {&#10;        retransmit_request();                  // WCET 更大的分支&#10;    }&#10;}&#10;// WCET = 循环上界 × 最坏迭代时间 + 最坏分支时间\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// 示例：分析此函数的 WCET</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> process_packet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">uint8_t</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">buf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">uint16_t</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    uint16_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> checksum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">uint16_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; i </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> len; i</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">      // 循环上界：len ≤ MAX_PACKET_SIZE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        checksum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> buf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[i];</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\">buf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[i] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">==</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> ESCAPE_CHAR) {</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">           // 条件分支</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">            checksum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+=</span><span style=\"color:#E36209;--shiki-dark:#FFAB70\"> buf</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">[</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">i];</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">              // 最坏路径</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (checksum </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">!=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> expected) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        retransmit_request</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">                  // WCET 更大的分支</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// WCET = 循环上界 × 最坏迭代时间 + 最坏分支时间</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"基于测量的方法\">基于测量的方法</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"bash\" data-code=\"# 使用硬件追踪器测量执行时间&#10;# ARM CoreSight ETM 追踪&#10;openocd -f target/stm32f4x.cfg -c &quot;etm config trace_all&quot;&#10;&#10;# 软件插桩测量&#10;# 在函数入口/出口读取 DWT Cycle Counter\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 使用硬件追踪器测量执行时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># ARM CoreSight ETM 追踪</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">openocd</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -f</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> target/stm32f4x.cfg</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> -c</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> \"etm config trace_all\"</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 软件插桩测量</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 在函数入口/出口读取 DWT Cycle Counter</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// ARM Cortex-M DWT 周期计数器&#10;#define DWT_CYCCNT (*(volatile uint32_t *)0xE0001004)&#10;#define DWT_CONTROL (*(volatile uint32_t *)0xE0001000)&#10;&#10;void enable_cycle_counter(void) {&#10;    CoreDebug-&gt;DEMCR |= CoreDebug_DEMCR_TRCENA_Msk;&#10;    DWT_CYCCNT = 0;&#10;    DWT_CONTROL |= 1;&#10;}&#10;&#10;uint32_t measure_wcet(void (*func)(void)) {&#10;    uint32_t max_cycles = 0;&#10;    for (int trial = 0; trial &lt; 10000; trial++) {&#10;        uint32_t start = DWT_CYCCNT;&#10;        func();&#10;        uint32_t elapsed = DWT_CYCCNT - start;&#10;        if (elapsed &gt; max_cycles) max_cycles = elapsed;&#10;    }&#10;    return max_cycles;  // 加安全裕度：max_cycles × 1.2&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// ARM Cortex-M DWT 周期计数器</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#define</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DWT_CYCCNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">volatile</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> uint32_t</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">E0001004</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">#define</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> DWT_CONTROL</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">volatile</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> uint32_t</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">0x</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">E0001000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> enable_cycle_counter</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    CoreDebug->DEMCR </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CoreDebug_DEMCR_TRCENA_Msk;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    DWT_CYCCNT </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    DWT_CONTROL </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">|=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">uint32_t</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> measure_wcet</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">func)(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">void</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    uint32_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> max_cycles </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">int</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> trial </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; trial </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">&#x3C;</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">; trial</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">++</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        uint32_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> start </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DWT_CYCCNT;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\">        func</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        uint32_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> elapsed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DWT_CYCCNT </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> start;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">        if</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (elapsed </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> max_cycles) max_cycles </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> elapsed;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> max_cycles;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">  // 加安全裕度：max_cycles × 1.2</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">}</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>分析方法</th>\n<th>安全性</th>\n<th>精度</th>\n<th>适用范围</th>\n<th>工具</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>静态分析</td>\n<td>保证上界</td>\n<td>可能过高估计</td>\n<td>简单处理器</td>\n<td>aiT、OTAWA</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>纯测量法</td>\n<td>无保证</td>\n<td>取决于测试覆盖</td>\n<td>通用</td>\n<td>Trace32、逻辑分析仪</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>混合方法</td>\n<td>较高安全性</td>\n<td>更精确</td>\n<td>复杂处理器</td>\n<td>RapiTime</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"响应时间分析\">响应时间分析</h2><p>响应时间分析（Response Time Analysis, RTA）是判定固定优先级系统可调度性的精确方法。任务的响应时间包括自身执行时间、高优先级任务的抢占时间和资源阻塞时间。</p>\n<h3 id=\"计算公式\">计算公式</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"Ri = Ci + Bi + Σ(⌈Ri/Tj⌉ × Cj)  对所有优先级高于 i 的任务 j&#10;&#10;其中：&#10;  Ri = 任务 i 的最坏响应时间&#10;  Ci = 任务 i 的 WCET&#10;  Bi = 任务 i 的最大阻塞时间（优先级反转）&#10;  Tj = 高优先级任务 j 的周期&#10;  Cj = 高优先级任务 j 的 WCET&#10;&#10;可调度条件：Ri ≤ Di（响应时间 ≤ 截止时间）\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>Ri = Ci + Bi + Σ(⌈Ri/Tj⌉ × Cj)  对所有优先级高于 i 的任务 j</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>其中：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Ri = 任务 i 的最坏响应时间</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Ci = 任务 i 的 WCET</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Bi = 任务 i 的最大阻塞时间（优先级反转）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Tj = 高优先级任务 j 的周期</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  Cj = 高优先级任务 j 的 WCET</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>可调度条件：Ri ≤ Di（响应时间 ≤ 截止时间）</span></span></code></pre></div><h3 id=\"迭代求解示例\">迭代求解示例</h3><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"text\" data-code=\"任务集：τ1(T=10,C=2), τ2(T=20,C=5), τ3(T=50,C=10)&#10;&#10;求 τ3 的响应时间：&#10;R3^0 = C3 = 10&#10;R3^1 = 10 + ⌈10/10⌉×2 + ⌈10/20⌉×5 = 10 + 2 + 5 = 17&#10;R3^2 = 10 + ⌈17/10⌉×2 + ⌈17/20⌉×5 = 10 + 4 + 5 = 19&#10;R3^3 = 10 + ⌈19/10⌉×2 + ⌈19/20⌉×5 = 10 + 4 + 5 = 19（收敛）&#10;&#10;R3 = 19ms ≤ D3 = 50ms → 可调度\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>任务集：τ1(T=10,C=2), τ2(T=20,C=5), τ3(T=50,C=10)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>求 τ3 的响应时间：</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>R3^0 = C3 = 10</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>R3^1 = 10 + ⌈10/10⌉×2 + ⌈10/20⌉×5 = 10 + 2 + 5 = 17</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>R3^2 = 10 + ⌈17/10⌉×2 + ⌈17/20⌉×5 = 10 + 4 + 5 = 19</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>R3^3 = 10 + ⌈19/10⌉×2 + ⌈19/20⌉×5 = 10 + 4 + 5 = 19（收敛）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>R3 = 19ms ≤ D3 = 50ms → 可调度</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"端到端延迟与多核时序\">端到端延迟与多核时序</h2><p>现代嵌入式系统通常是多核分布式架构，端到端延迟分析需要考虑任务链（Task Chain）跨核通信和总线仲裁的影响。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph LR&#10;    A[传感器采样] --&gt;|Core 0| B[信号处理]&#10;    B --&gt;|共享内存| C[控制算法]&#10;    C --&gt;|Core 1| D[执行器输出]&#10;    A --&gt;|采样延迟| E[Ls]&#10;    B --&gt;|处理延迟| F[Lp]&#10;    C --&gt;|通信延迟| G[Lc]&#10;    D --&gt;|执行延迟| H[La]\">graph LR\n    A[传感器采样] --&gt;|Core 0| B[信号处理]\n    B --&gt;|共享内存| C[控制算法]\n    C --&gt;|Core 1| D[执行器输出]\n    A --&gt;|采样延迟| E[Ls]\n    B --&gt;|处理延迟| F[Lp]\n    C --&gt;|通信延迟| G[Lc]\n    D --&gt;|执行延迟| H[La]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>延迟分量</th>\n<th>来源</th>\n<th>典型范围</th>\n<th>优化手段</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>采样延迟</td>\n<td>ADC 转换 + 滤波</td>\n<td>10-100μs</td>\n<td>DMA 传输、硬件滤波</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>调度延迟</td>\n<td>RTOS 调度器开销</td>\n<td>1-10μs</td>\n<td>提高优先级、减少抢占</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>计算延迟</td>\n<td>算法执行时间</td>\n<td>50μs-5ms</td>\n<td>算法优化、查找表</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>通信延迟</td>\n<td>核间通信 / 总线</td>\n<td>5-50μs</td>\n<td>共享内存、硬件信号量</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>执行器延迟</td>\n<td>PWM 更新 + 机械响应</td>\n<td>100μs-10ms</td>\n<td>提高 PWM 频率</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"c\" data-code=\"// AUTOSAR 风格的端到端延迟规约&#10;typedef struct {&#10;    uint32_t max_age_ms;       // 数据最大年龄&#10;    uint32_t max_e2e_delay_ms; // 端到端最大延迟&#10;    uint8_t  timeout_action;   // 超时处理策略&#10;} e2e_timing_constraint_t;&#10;&#10;e2e_timing_constraint_t brake_constraint = {&#10;    .max_age_ms = 10,&#10;    .max_e2e_delay_ms = 20,&#10;    .timeout_action = SAFE_STATE&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">// AUTOSAR 风格的端到端延迟规约</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">typedef</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> struct</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    uint32_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> max_age_ms;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">       // 数据最大年龄</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    uint32_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> max_e2e_delay_ms;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"> // 端到端最大延迟</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    uint8_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">  timeout_action;</span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">   // 超时处理策略</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">} </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e2e_timing_constraint_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">e2e_timing_constraint_t</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> brake_constraint </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .max_age_ms </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .max_e2e_delay_ms </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 20</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    .timeout_action </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> SAFE_STATE</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">};</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>实时系统的正确性同时包含逻辑正确性和时间正确性，时序违反可能导致灾难性后果</li>\n<li>WCET 分析是时序验证的基石，静态分析保证安全但可能过度悲观，测量法需要加安全裕度</li>\n<li>响应时间分析（RTA）是精确判定固定优先级系统可调度性的标准方法</li>\n<li>端到端延迟分析需要考虑完整任务链上的所有延迟分量，包括采样、计算、通信和执行延迟</li>\n<li>安全关键系统（DO-178C、ISO 26262）要求形式化的时序分析和 WCET 证据</li>\n<li>多核系统的时序分析需额外考虑核间通信延迟和共享资源争用</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"实时约束与时序分析","id":"实时约束与时序分析"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"WCET 最坏执行时间分析","id":"wcet-最坏执行时间分析"},{"level":3,"text":"静态分析方法","id":"静态分析方法"},{"level":3,"text":"基于测量的方法","id":"基于测量的方法"},{"level":2,"text":"响应时间分析","id":"响应时间分析"},{"level":3,"text":"计算公式","id":"计算公式"},{"level":3,"text":"迭代求解示例","id":"迭代求解示例"},{"level":2,"text":"端到端延迟与多核时序","id":"端到端延迟与多核时序"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"低功耗设计","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/embedded-systems-iot/rtos-and-scheduling/low-power-design"},"next":{"title":"任务调度算法","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/embedded-systems-iot/rtos-and-scheduling/task-scheduling-algorithms"}}